msgid "[`qiskit_bosons.transpiler`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-bosons/transpiler#module-qiskit_bosons.transpiler \"qiskit_bosons.transpiler\") for the full description of the stages and the available passes.\n"
